<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/37/eng@/~cl_11__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (2), by substituting for the words “shall be guilty of an offence and shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding five thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding one year or to both” the words “commits an offence”. Amendment of section 26"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/37/eng@> .
