<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/37/eng@/~cl_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Paragraph 4(1)(f) of the principal Act is amended by deleting the words “of the Authority”. New section 7a"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/37/eng@> .
