<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/37/eng@/~cl_7__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "in subsection (1)— “(ba) to advise the Federal Government on any matters relating to highways; (bb) to formulate, implement and monitor the standard for highways; (bc) to undertake the planning, design, construction, operation, management and maintenance of highways; (bd) to improve the information management system relating to traffic on highways; (be) to improve the infrastructure and facilities for highways;”; “(ca) to impose fees or any other charges for services rendered by the Authority as determined by the Minister;”; “(e) to do anything incidental to any of its functions under this Act.”; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2023/37/eng@> .
